FAVICON PLACEHOLDER
===================

This is a placeholder file. Replace with an actual favicon.ico file before production.

Recommended favicon sizes:
- 16x16 pixels (browser tab)
- 32x32 pixels (browser tab, Windows)
- 48x48 pixels (Windows site icon)
- 180x180 pixels (Apple Touch Icon)

To generate favicons:
1. Create a 512x512 PNG logo
2. Use a tool like https://realfavicongenerator.net/ or https://favicon.io/
3. Replace this file with the generated favicon.ico
4. Add additional favicon files to the public folder as needed:
   - apple-touch-icon.png (180x180)
   - favicon-32x32.png
   - favicon-16x16.png
   - site.webmanifest